# Scripta CN 720 as an HSC aluminium machine: the stock frame (working area
# 700 x 430 mm, Z 200 mm, 210 kg), ball screws and SEW CMP40M servos on
# every axis, an ISO20 ATC spindle (~10 kg with its cylinder). Masses and
# stiffnesses are estimates, to be replaced with measurements (weigh the
# table, the carriage and the Z slide; tap-test the head and the bridge).
#
# Semi-closed loop: every axis on its motor's resolver.
include cn720_frame.inc
#
# Drives: config(s), sim lines, pitch [mm]
drive x cmp40m.conf,x.conf sim.txt 10
drive y cmp40m.conf,y.conf sim.txt 10
drive z cmp40m.conf,z.conf sim.txt 5
brake z
rnoise x 1
rnoise y 1
rnoise z 1
